Suggests: upx-ucl, yara
Description: Binary intelligence and static malware analysis toolkit
 UNPACKR identifies, parses and assesses executables statically and offline
 (PE, ELF, Mach-O), infers capabilities with evidence and confidence, extracts
 indicators, and unpacks UPX and extracts PyInstaller bundles. Samples are
 never executed. Optional tools such as upx are used only when present.
